    "[taal, protected word] 'solank ons dit nie vinniger gebruik as wat die natuur dit aa': In the block 'Wat die natuur weer aanvul' the sentence starts 'Hulle raak nie op nie' (the son, wind and water), so the protected 'dit ... dit' disagrees in number with its antecedent; 'hulle ... hulle' would agree. The glossary entry, which starts with 'Dit', is fine. Left unchanged because the wording is protected."
